<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7118] performance measurement for distributed k-means clustering</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7118</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We want to start tracking our performance to avoid performance degradation. Also we need some performance comparison with other ml libs.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Initial draft for this benchmark was made per &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6123&quot; title=&quot;First performance measurement of implemented ml algorithms&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6123&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-6123&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (class &lt;tt&gt;IgniteKMeansDistributedClustererBenchmark&lt;/tt&gt;) but it currently fails because of the implementation issues reported in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6849&quot; title=&quot;Failed k-means tests with multiple nodes&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6849&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-6849&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; so it is excluded.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Enable this benchmark and re-test it using codebase that has has corrected implementation.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13122956">IGNITE-7118</key>
            <summary>performance measurement for distributed k-means clustering</summary>
