                            <comment id="16279035" author="oignatenko" created="Tue, 5 Dec 2017 18:50:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fix for &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6849&quot; title=&quot;Failed k-means tests with multiple nodes&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6849&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-6849&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is currently merged to master. I checked benchmark with part of the changes done per this fix and it appears to run fine.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Plan to do as follows: After &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6123&quot; title=&quot;First performance measurement of implemented ml algorithms&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6123&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-6123&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is merged to master, enable the benchmark, remove &quot;TODO&quot; comment from &lt;tt&gt;IgniteKMeansDistributedClustererBenchmark&lt;/tt&gt;, re-run it with master codebase and fix if there are any other issues found.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This entry needs to be added to file &lt;tt&gt;ignite-ml.properties&lt;/tt&gt; in order to enable benchmark:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-none&quot;&gt;-cfg ${SCRIPT_DIR}/../config/ignite-localhost-config.xml -nn ${nodesNum} -b ${b} -w ${w} -d ${d} -t ${t} -sm ${sm} -dn IgniteKMeansDistributedClustererBenchmark -sn IgniteNode -ds ${ver}kmeans-distributed-clusterer-${b}-backup,\
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
